# The Dockerfile COPYs only the specific paths it needs (see its COPY
# instructions) — that explicit list, not this file, is what keeps
# secrets and native-platform cruft out of the image. .env is
# deliberately NOT excluded here: the Dockerfile does `COPY .env ./`
# on purpose (envied needs it at build time), and .dockerignore entries
# remove files from the build context entirely — excluding .env here
# would make that COPY fail with "file not found".

android/
ios/
integration_test/
test/
tools/
fastlane/
docs/

build/
.dart_tool/
.fvm/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.hive

.git/
.github/
